Summary
  best NEON kernel here:  NEON 1x4                5843456 keys/s on one thread
  SME streaming mode is not available on this machine.
  The NEON kernels here are plain C, not the client's tuned cores. For the real
  comparison, also run "dnetc -bench rc5-72" and note its per-core rate.
